'use strict';
// data/voice/dialog-ch4.js — Chapter 4 spoken dialogue clips, keyed 'voice|exact text' (data/dialog-cast.js). Built from the
// Chapter Voice Baker with claude/voice-merge-dialog.js; do not hand-edit.
Object.assign(DIALOG_CLIPS.clips,{"tom|You took the train to meet the plane.":"","tnb|I took the train to meet the man. The plane was a bonus.":"","tnb|Big shoot today. BACKLOT BEDLAM. Car chases, a saloon, a fake New York. I have forty costumes on one rack, and every single one is steamed.":"","tnb|Very, very important. I have a lanyard.":"","tom|Hi. Hi. Yes. I know. I was gone FOREVER. It was six days.":"","moss|Sunset Gold Studios. Closed set. Name?":"","dot|It was right there in Stage 7. Then the fog machine turned itself on, and the lights went out, and things started CLAPPING.":"","tom|Friction Sprites. On a closed set.":"","la_woman|And the Backlot is full of little grumpy things. One of them ate a cue card. One of them is clapping at the horse.":"","tnb|Babe. Forty costumes. I steamed every single one. By hand. While humming.":"","tom|Then we go get them back. Nara, stay close. This is a professional environment.":"","tnb|The Backlot. Main Street up on the left, the Western street on the right, New York down on the left. All fake. All very expensive.":"","tnb|She peed on the hydrant. That hydrant is fiberglass. That hydrant is a PROP.":"","tom|Good girl. Professional environment, very good girl.":"","tnb|And it smells like fog juice. The grape kind. Only Stage 7 has a fog machine.":"","tom|Then we clear the sets. One at a time. Main Street, the Western street, New York.":"","grump|Pinch. This is MY set. I hold up the lines. Every line. I hold up this one: GO AWAY.":"","tnb|Cut. Reset. Back to one. Everybody gets a touch-up.":"","tnb|Main Street is clear. The bank is safe. The pie is still foam.":"","dot|(on the radio) ...kkkt... Stage 7! The big door just unlocked itself! From the INSIDE! Is that bad? That feels bad.":"","toad|SNAP! Scene one, take one! SNAP! I go first! Nothing happens until I clap! SNAP!":"","tom|The Western street is clear. The horse can come out of its trailer now.":"","tnb|Watch the screech, babe. It shuts you right up. No skills.":"","skeeter|Bzzz. I hear everything on this set. Everything. Your knees click, Tom.":"","tom|The stage set is at the top. The rack is up there. I can smell the steamer.":"","tnb|The main light rig runs the catwalk motor. If I get power back to it, the catwalk comes down.":"","tnb|Three junction boxes. They have to come up in the right order or the dimmer pops. The rig will tell us the order.":"","tom|You fixed a whole soundstage with tape.":"","tnb|Blue, amber, red. And one strip of gaffer tape. Okay, two. Okay, four.":"","tnb|I fix everything with tape. You know this. Your kitchen drawer knows this.":"","tnb|My rack. MY RACK. All forty. Still steamed. Oh, I could cry.":"","tom|You took the rack.":"","bigone|CUT! CUT! CUT! Who said you could walk onto my set? The blocking is WRONG.":"","tnb|Back to one, everybody. Touch-ups.":"","tnb|Babe, when it says CUT, put WARDROBE on whoever is next. When it braces, Popcorn Jump. Or just tell it GREAT TAKE. Three times.":"","tnb|And look. Somebody stuck a note on the steamer. \"Paid in full.\" With a gold coin taped to it.":"","tnb|Spooky. I love it. I hate it. Help me push. This thing has four wheels and four opinions.":"","tnb|You know what this whole day was? A real steam-ulating experience.":"","tom|...":"","tnb|Worth it?":"","tom|I flew three thousand miles for that pun.":"","tom|A text from Amy. \"Parent-teacher conference night is Thursday. Thirty parents. I need backup. Bring snacks. And bring the good uncle.\"":"","moss|Nobody came through my gate. Nobody with legs.":"","moss|Ray here. Shoot wrapped. Nobody got past me. Except the megaphone. And the moths. And the dog.":"","moss|Tom. Plus one dog. Plus one boyfriend who already works here. Fine. Go on in.":"","moss|Little things, though. Buzzing. Clapping. One of them asked me for a compliment. I said no. I regret it.":"","bun|The crew eats like a swarm of locusts. Polite locusts. With lanyards.":"","dot|We WRAPPED! On time! Well. Four hours late. Which is on time for us.":"","dot|Rack two is still missing. Forty costumes. The actors are filming in bathrobes.":"","dot|Last thing on my radio before the static was the Stage 7 fog machine. It turned itself on.":"","dot|Kiki. Production assistant. I have a headset, three radios and zero answers.":"","la_woman|We got the shot. All of them. Even the one with the horse.":"","la_woman|Tell TNB the costumes looked incredible. Tell him I said incredible. Tell him twice.":"","grump|Round 2. I got a new coat. Same coat, actually.":"","grump|Round 3. I got a new coat. Same coat, actually.":"","grump|Round 4. I got a new coat. Same coat, actually.":"","grump|...Nine hours in holding. Nine.":"","grump|Round 5. I got a new coat. Same coat, actually.":"","skeeter|I hang over everybody all day. Nobody looks up. Nobody says thank you.":"","skeeter|Round 2. I can hear you breathing.":"","skeeter|Round 3. I can hear you breathing.":"","skeeter|Round 4. I can hear you breathing.":"","skeeter|Round 5. I can hear you breathing.":"","toad|Take two! Snap!":"","toad|Every take starts with me and nobody remembers me.":"","toad|SNAP. I go first. I ALWAYS go first. Nothing happens until I clap.":"","toad|Round 2. Rolling. Speed. SNAP.":"","toad|Round 3. Rolling. Speed. SNAP.":"","toad|Round 4. Rolling. Speed. SNAP.":"","toad|Round 5. Rolling. Speed. SNAP.":"","mudling|Back again. Thicker.":"","mudling|They pump me in and then they open the doors. Every time.":"","mudling|Everything looks better in fog. Mysterious. Soft. Nobody can see anybody.":"","mudling|Round 3. Can you see me? No. Good.":"","mudling|Round 2. Can you see me? No. Good.":"","mudling|Round 4. Can you see me? No. Good.":"","mudling|Round 5. Can you see me? No. Good.":"","grump|Pinch. I wrote that one myself.":"","grump|New cards. Same feelings.":"","grump|I hold up the lines. Every line. Nobody ever says \"nice handwriting.\"":"","grump|Round 2. This card says ROUND 2.":"","grump|Round 3. This card says ROUND 3.":"","grump|Round 4. This card says ROUND 4.":"","grump|Round 5. This card says ROUND 5.":"","grump|Nobody reads my cards. They read the actors.":"","bigone|From the top!":"","bigone|CUT! CUT! Again! The light was wrong! The FEELING was wrong!":"","bigone|Round 2. Take 2. Still wrong.":"","bigone|Round 3. Take 3. Still wrong.":"","bigone|Round 4. Take 4. Still wrong.":"","bigone|Round 5. Take 5. Still wrong.":"","bigone|Nobody gets it right. NOBODY.":"","bigone|...From the top. Again. Always from the top.":"","sal|The studio lot is at the east end of the boulevard. Big gate. Grumpy guard.":"","sal|Airport? You JUST landed. Your young man is on a shoot. Go watch him be important.":""});
Object.assign(DIALOG_CLIPS.voices,{"tnb":{"voice_id":"QPmHuIriDGOvu1d9U7wn","name":"SuperDale - a mid-age voice & Friendly  (male, middle_aged, us midwest, informative_educational)","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.85},"direction":"","designed":false},"tom":{"voice_id":"cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal","name":"Eric - Smooth, Trustworthy","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.85},"direction":"","designed":false},"moss":{"voice_id":"7vp7iK3I8DiDLgC90c3t","name":"AoT Moss","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A tall, gentle man in his thirties with a deep, slow, mellow American voice. Dreamy and laid back, long pauses, quietly pleased with his own puns. Warm low tone. Clean studio recording."},"dot":{"voice_id":"gYzudf4C0nXnEecqXK5t","name":"AoT Dot","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A small woman in her forties with a quick, crisp, precise American voice, slightly nasal. Talks fast in short exact phrases like she is reading a tally sheet. Proud of her accuracy. Clean studio recording."},"la_woman":{"voice_id":"eLXwnyHT9UJHbuyheJ9m","name":"AoT LA neighbor (woman)","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A woman in her early thirties with a relaxed, warm, slightly husky Los Angeles voice. Easygoing, wry, a little tired, friendly neighbor energy. Clean studio recording."},"bun":{"voice_id":"FSFvvh3OTPle9DfVJIu3","name":"AoT Bun","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A woman in her thirties with a bubbly, warm, bright American voice. Friendly shop greeter energy, smiling while she talks, loves a bread pun. Clean studio recording."},"grump":{"voice_id":"moX2FuSiiLmOw0uEq4OU","name":"AoT Pond Grump","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A grumpy cartoon swamp creature, low gravelly grumbling voice, cranky and wet-sounding, easily offended, a big softie underneath. Animated character voice."},"toad":{"voice_id":"jcb48kKcDpNXjAxnAP2c","name":"AoT Bog Toad","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A huge cartoon toad, deep croaky throaty voice with a rumbling ribbit, territorial and proud, a bit vain. Animated character voice."},"skeeter":{"voice_id":"3NkCp1SubvPIw3g0s7Rf","name":"AoT Skeeter Swarm","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A cartoon swarm of mosquitoes speaking as one, high-pitched, thin, whiny and buzzy voice with a nasal zzz on every s, nosy and impatient. Animated character voice."},"bigone":{"voice_id":"qDteMRfOWoUEc7kcfWvl","name":"AoT The Big One","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"An enormous ancient cartoon pond fish, huge slow booming bass voice with gurgling bubbles, pompous and boastful but childlike and easily delighted underneath. Animated character voice."},"mudling":{"voice_id":"E2hOWZ8x3nGJuQURP3SG","name":"AoT Mudling","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A small, silly cartoon creature made of mud, gloopy gurgling voice with wet bubbly consonants, slow and sulky, childlike and a little sad. Animated character voice."},"sal":{"voice_id":"gcJ5PkVgShIxtP5HgbZK","name":"AoT Sal","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A man in his fifties with a thick Long Island New York accent, a slightly nasal, raspy, fast and friendly voice. Chatty taxi driver, warm and a little dramatic, proud of his one cab. Clean studio recording."},"rose":{"voice_id":"ocZQ262SsZb9RIxcQBOj","name":"Lulu Lolipop - High-Pitched and Bubbly  (female, young, american, characters_animation)","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.85},"direction":"","designed":false},"grace":{"voice_id":"i4CzbCVWoqvD0P1QJCUL","name":"Ivy","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":false},"deedee":{"voice_id":"3atomJkX2UWSHPSg86Z0","name":"AoT Deedee (Long Island)","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":false},"boppy":{"voice_id":"QzTKubutNn9TjrB7Xb2Q","name":"Jerry B. - New York Italian Mobster  (male, middle_aged, new york, characters_animation)","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":1},"direction":"deep gravelly voice","designed":false},"log":{"voice_id":"DmA9AOv6Fsic2LQdqVVM","name":"AoT Log Lump","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A sleepy cartoon log creature, very slow, deep, woody and drowsy voice, yawning between words, mumbly and content. Animated character voice."},"amy":{"voice_id":"HLSHrV3D7Gp6sEFcHNev","name":"AoT Amy (Kind)","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"heavy Long Island accent","designed":false},"boomie":{"voice_id":"FgGtmhYdBou3a14mKYgx","name":"AoT Boomie","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A woman in her forties with a big, warm, rich singer’s voice, bubbly and motherly, slides into song mid-sentence, laughs from the belly. Clean studio recording."},"bean":{"voice_id":"zROpM0X5rfQMe4CN4C7f","name":"AoT Bean","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A man in his late twenties with an upbeat, rambling, friendly American voice. A little scattered, quick bursts of words, cheerful and unbothered. Light and bright. Clean studio recording."},"carmen":{"voice_id":"8ncJvaxiyfELP457mBLS","name":"AoT Doña Carmen","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A woman in her sixties with a warm, firm, proud voice and a light Salvadoran Spanish accent. Runs a pupuseria, generous and no-nonsense, laughs easily. Clean studio recording."},"pistachio":{"voice_id":"LyoSZrqTSG25l7i0uBGl","name":"AoT Mr. Pistachio","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A man in his late fifties with a warm, hearty Long Island New York accent, an ice cream shop owner who loves his regulars, booming friendly laugh, talks with his hands, a little dramatic about his scoops. Clean studio recording."},"brainfreeze":{"voice_id":"kYM9iwUI7t87mhAOBs1T","name":"AoT Brain Freeze","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A cartoon villain who is a walking chest freezer: a flat, cold, humming monotone with a slight metallic buzz, deadpan and sulky, slow and heavy, with a lonely sadness underneath that cracks through when he is surprised. Animated character voice."},"boomie2":{"voice_id":"rrjdoujYPDo3FGeRqm3Q","name":"AoT Boomie","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A young Black American woman in her late thirties to early fourties with a warm, rich, low alto voice, smooth and a little husky, deeper than most women’s voices. A gospel and soul singer, kind and bubbly, laughs from the belly, slides into song mid-sentence. Clean studio recording."},"michael":{"voice_id":"24fSFWvKYGI0zVR7L6JQ","name":"AoT Michael","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A tall man in his early forties with a calm, low, dry American voice. A tech dad holding two kids, patient, deadpan, quietly funny, a little tired. Clean studio recording."},"penny":{"voice_id":"C0jocNoR6bwrjLXwelto","name":"AoT Penny","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A woman in her forties with a fast-talking, bright, enthusiastic American saleswoman voice. Quick patter, playful, warm and a little pushy, every line a pitch. Clean studio recording."},"page":{"voice_id":"UnNThlnnIcLaHiWDpFdl","name":"AoT Page","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A man in his forties, a librarian with a hushed, dry, whispery American voice. Speaks very quietly and precisely, mildly scandalized by everything, droll. Soft breathy whisper. Clean studio recording."},"olivia":{"voice_id":"3KdkB2LF6PUw0muuS0j7","name":"AoT Olivia","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A woman in her late thirties with a quick, bright, articulate American voice. A journalist and mom of two little kids, talks fast, wry and warm, always half distracted. Clean studio recording."},"luna":{"voice_id":"qCj5kMANfHcvCnzG1gVB","name":"AoT Luna","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A woman in her thirties with a dreamy, slow, wonder-filled American voice. Soft and spacey, drifting pauses, sincere awe with a touch of embarrassment. Clean studio recording."},"justin":{"voice_id":"Pp9gl3BrnVq62dIWU2sx","name":"AoT Justin (Long Island)","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A man in his early forties with an easygoing, friendly voice, Long Island born with a slight country twang. Goofy proud dad, handyman, sports fan, relaxed and warm, quick to laugh. Clean studio recording."},"gus":{"voice_id":"CcabrpeMRBXae9HlsCuq","name":"AoT Gus","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"An old man in his seventies with a slow, warm, slightly creaky American voice. Deadpan and dignified, treats sitting on a bench like serious athletic training. Unhurried. Clean studio recording."},"oolong":{"voice_id":"2PhKaj7sDKqdDEhqQyhl","name":"AoT Oolong","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"An elderly woman in her seventies with a warm, gossipy, conspiratorial voice and a light British accent. Leans in to share secrets, little cackle of a laugh, cozy and sly. Clean studio recording."},"washington":{"voice_id":"ARRjeRIXQjOrcraWRDoq","name":"AoT Mr. Washington","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"An elderly man in his eighties with a deep, warm, slow voice and a gentle hint of Louisiana in it. A neighborhood storyteller on his porch, unhurried, kind, a little gravelly. Clean studio recording."}});
